.el .ds Aq '
.TH localflyd 1  "localflyd 0.1.0" 
.SH NAME
localflyd \- Localfly Linux tunnel daemon (Unix socket, auto\-spawned by the CLI)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlocalflyd\fR [\fB\-\-socket\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Localfly Linux tunnel daemon (Unix socket, auto\-spawned by the CLI)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-socket\fR \fI<SOCKET>\fR
Unix socket path (default: $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/localfly.sock). Also settable via LOCALFLY_SOCKET
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0
